    "legal_4_title": "4. Copyright",
    "legal_4_desc": "© 2024-2026. All rights reserved. No reverse engineering allowed.",
    "legal_1_full": "<h3>Disclaimer of Liability</h3><p>The <b>Synthesis</b> application is provided \"as is\" and \"as available\" without any express or implied warranty of any kind, including but not limited to warranties of merchantability, non-infringement, or fitness for a particular purpose.</p><p>The creators and developers of the application assume absolutely no liability for any data loss, technical failures, service interruptions, financial damages, or any direct/indirect damage arising from the use of the application in a production environment.</p><h3>Accuracy of Artificial Intelligence (AI)</h3><p>The use of Artificial Intelligence (AI) models for extracting data from physical production reports is experimental and may sometimes produce inaccurate results or misinterpret data. Users bear the sole responsibility to review, verify, and confirm the accuracy of all extracted data (including quantities, materials, and mixture compositions) before finally saving them to the local database.</p><h3>No Professional Advice</h3><p>The theoretical calculations, statistical analyses, and compliance alerts (SPC deviations) provided by the App are intended for informational and internal management purposes only. They do not constitute certified engineering, legal, or professional advice. Final production decisions must always be validated by qualified personnel.</p>",
    "legal_2_full": "<h3>Privacy Policy & GDPR Compliance</h3><p>Effective Date: October 2026</p><p>We respect your privacy (Privacy by Design) and comply with personal data protection regulations (GDPR). This page is a summary; the <a href=\"privacy-policy.html\">full Privacy Policy</a> describes every case in detail.</p><h3>1. Account & Cloud Synchronization</h3><p>If you create an account (Email/Password, Google or Apple Sign-In), we receive your email address, display name and a unique user ID. While you are signed in, your production data (reports, mixtures, materials, fuel logs, sites, tanks, lab tests) is synchronized to Google Cloud Firestore under your account, encrypted in transit and at rest. Server-side security rules ensure that only you can access it.</p><h3>2. Organizations (Team Sharing)</h3><p>If you create or join an organization, the data you enter for its plants is shared with the organization's members. Every change is recorded in the organization's change history together with the display name (or email) of the member who made it. Invitations store the invitee's email address until they are accepted.</p><h3>3. Offline Mode</h3><p>You can enable <b>Offline Mode</b> from the application settings. In Offline Mode your data is not synchronized to the cloud and stays only on your device. Features that you use explicitly (AI OCR, the site map) and crash reports still connect to their services.</p><h3>4. Local Data Storage</h3><p>Production data, reports and statistics are stored on your device in an encrypted SQLite database.</p><h3>5. Use of AI Services (Gemini, OpenAI, Claude, DeepSeek)</h3><p>The production report digitization feature (AI OCR) is optional and operates under a Bring Your Own Key (BYOK) model; the App asks for your consent before using it. Photographs of production sheets that you explicitly choose to scan are sent encrypted (HTTPS/TLS) directly from your device to the API of the AI provider you selected, strictly to extract the production data. By default, text recognition runs entirely on your device (Google ML Kit) and no image leaves it.</p><p>The App does not retain or upload your photos to its own servers. At the AI provider level, processing and any temporary retention (e.g., up to 30 days strictly for security and abuse monitoring purposes by OpenAI and Anthropic) are governed by the official Terms of Service and settings of the account you maintain with each provider. Note that for Google Gemini, exclusion from public model training is guaranteed when using an account with an active billing tier (Paid/Tiered API).</p><h3>6. Crash Reports</h3><p>The App sends crash reports to Firebase Crashlytics so that we can fix bugs. They contain the error, the device model, the operating-system and app version and a random installation identifier — not your production data, your email or your documents — and are never used for advertising or tracking.</p><h3>7. Map</h3><p>The site map loads its images from OpenStreetMap; as with any web request, your IP address and the map area you view are visible to the OpenStreetMap Foundation. The App does not use your device's GPS location.</p><h3>8. Biometric Authentication</h3><p>App locking mechanisms (FaceID / TouchID / PIN) are executed exclusively at the operating system level of your device. Synthesis does not collect, process, or have access to your biometric data.</p><h3>9. Data Deletion (Full Wipe)</h3><p>You can permanently delete your account from the App's Account Settings. This <b>Full Wipe</b> irreversibly erases your data from your device and from our cloud servers. Data you entered for an organization belongs to that organization and remains available to its other members. For any deletion request, email <a href=\"mailto:kwstas147@gmail.com\">kwstas147@gmail.com</a>; we respond within 48 hours.</p>",
    "legal_3_full": "<h3>Cookie Policy</h3><p>This website is a static distribution page hosted and provided via <b>GitHub Pages</b>.</p><h3>Tracking & Analytics</h3><p>Our website is completely static. We <b>do not use</b> tracking cookies, Google Analytics, tracking pixels, or any other user profiling mechanisms. We do not share any browsing data with third parties for advertising or marketing purposes.</p><h3>Essential Hosting Cookies</h3><p>Because this site is hosted on GitHub Pages, GitHub (as the hosting provider) may utilize certain <i>strictly necessary cookies</i> (essential cookies) required for the secure, fast, and proper functioning of their infrastructure (e.g., protection against DDoS attacks, Load Balancing, and network routing). By browsing this website, you accept this core technical functionality.</p><h3>Local Storage</h3><p>We use your browser's Local Storage solely to remember your UI preferences, specifically:<ul><li>Your preferred language (Greek or English).</li><li>Your preferred visual theme (Light or Dark mode).</li></ul>These preferences remain on your device and are never transmitted to our servers.</p>",
    "legal_4_full": "<h3>Copyright & Terms of Use</h3><p><b>© 2024-2026 Synthesis. All rights reserved.</b></p><h3>Intellectual Property</h3><p>The entire codebase, application design, system architecture, User Interface (UI), User Experience (UX) flows, and the Synthesis logo are the exclusive intellectual property of the creators and developers.</p><h3>Prohibited Actions</h3><p>It is strictly prohibited to engage in any of the following activities without prior explicit written permission from the creators:<ul><li>Unauthorized reproduction, copying, or distribution of the application (APK/AAB files) outside of this official repository.</li><li>Reverse engineering, decompiling, or disassembling the application's source code or compiled binaries.</li><li>Commercial exploitation, resale, or sublicensing of the software.</li><li>Modification or creation of derivative works based on the Synthesis application.</li></ul></p><h3>Trademarks</h3><p>All third-party trademarks (such as Google Gemini, OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Apple, Android) mentioned within the application or this website are the property of their respective owners.</p>",
